<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher on Thursday in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 568.72, up 3.43.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 292 to 230.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.08.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,267,460 compared with 18,664,290 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
